.TH "MODULE-SETTING-UPDATE" "1" "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
module:setting:update \- Update a configuration setting for a specific module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php module:setting:update
.I <modulename> <key> <value>
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmodule:setting:update\fR validates and updates a configuration value for a target module,
writing the change to the active application's module configuration file and invalidating
cached configuration structures.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR <modulename>
Internal name or directory basename of the module.
.TP
.BR <key>
Configuration setting key name.
.TP
.BR <value>
New value to assign.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Validates schema definition, writes through \fBModuleConfigManager::setConfig()\fR, and clears cache.
.SH AUTHOR
Satya Prakash Shukla
